  "details": "Description\n\nThe game has no sound at all, but other games are fine. The headphones are working, and the output settings are correct. There's sound when I log into the headset, but the PC version has no sound at all. I hope they can add an output device setting in the game.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI don't know how this bug happened, but it did. My game has no sound at all, only the headset has sound, so when I need to do something in the PC version of VRChat, I can't hear anything.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 音频\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-17_20-42-53.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_e9892dc7-8d68-44a9-9d59-6e1e6fa40de4/1/file)",
